{"id":"mtk-05c-konversi-luas-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-05","subBab":"mtk-05c","slug":"konversi-luas","tier":"campur","title":"OSN/KSN SD — MTK · Sub-Bab 05c: Konversi Satuan Luas (Tingkat Campur)","theory":[{"title":"1. Tangga Satuan Luas","content":"Satuan luas standar dari yang **terbesar** ke **terkecil**:\n\n```\nkm²  →  hm²  →  dam²  →  m²  →  dm²  →  cm²  →  mm²\n```\n\n**Aturan emas**:\n- **TURUN 1 anak tangga → KALI 100 (×100)**\n- **NAIK 1 anak tangga → BAGI 100 (÷100)**\n\n⚠️ **Awas jebakan**: kalau panjang (m, cm, mm) kelipatannya 10. **Luas kelipatannya 100**, karena luas = panjang × panjang. Misal 1 m = 10 dm, tapi 1 m² = 10 × 10 = **100 dm²**."},{"title":"2. Hubungan Cepat yang Wajib Hafal","content":"- 1 km² = 100 hm² = 10.000 dam² = **1.000.000 m²**\n- 1 m² = 100 dm² = **10.000 cm²** = 1.000.000 mm²\n- 1 cm² = **100 mm²**\n- 1 hm² = 10.000 m²\n- 1 dam² = 100 m²"},{"title":"3. Satuan Agraria (Tanah/Sawah/Kebun)","content":"Sering muncul di soal cerita pertanian:\n- **1 hektar (ha)** = 10.000 m² = **1 hm²**\n- **1 are (a)** = 100 m² = **1 dam²**\n- **1 sentiare (ca)** = 1 m²\n\nHubungan praktis: 1 ha = 100 are. Jadi kalau ada \"kebun 5 ha\", artinya 50.000 m² atau 500 are."},{"title":"4. Cara Hitung Cepat — Geser Koma / Nol","content":"Karena tiap tingkat ×100, **geser koma 2 angka** untuk tiap tingkat.\n\nContoh: 4 m² = ... cm²\n- Dari m² ke cm² turun 2 tingkat (m² → dm² → cm²).\n- 2 tingkat = ×100 ×100 = ×10.000.\n- 4 × 10.000 = **40.000 cm²**.\n\nContoh: 250.000 cm² = ... m²\n- Dari cm² ke m² naik 2 tingkat → ÷10.000.\n- 250.000 ÷ 10.000 = **25 m²**."},{"title":"5. Konversi dari Panjang ke Luas","content":"Kalau ada bentuk persegi/persegi panjang, hitung luas dulu baru konversi.\n- Sisi 1 m → luas = 1 m × 1 m = **1 m²** (BUKAN 1 m × 1 m = 10 m²!).\n- Persegi panjang 2 m × 3 m → luas = 6 m² = 60.000 cm²."},{"title":"6. Tips Hindari Salah","content":"- **Selalu cek satuan target**: km², m², atau cm²?\n- **Hitung loncatan tingkat**: m² ke cm² = 2 tingkat, jadi ×10.000.\n- **Jangan pakai ×10** untuk luas — itu aturan panjang.\n- Kalau soal beri \"ha\", langsung ubah ke m² (×10.000) supaya lebih mudah."},{"title":"7. Kesalahan Umum (Distractor Favorit OSN)","content":"- Memakai aturan panjang (×10) padahal soal luas → hasilnya 10× terlalu kecil/besar.\n- Salah hitung tingkat (mis. anggap m² ke cm² = 1 tingkat, padahal 2).\n- Salah arah konversi: naik tapi ×, atau turun tapi ÷.\n- Lupa kalau 1 ha = 1 hm² (bukan 1 km²!).\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"🟢 SEKSI A","level":"Kab","question":"Setiap turun satu tingkat pada tangga satuan luas, bilangan harus dikali ...","options":{"A":"100","B":"10","C":"1.000","D":"1.000.000"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"🟢 SEKSI A","level":"Kab","question":"1 m² sama dengan ...","options":{"A":"10 dm²","B":"100 dm²","C":"1.000 dm²","D":"10.000 dm²"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"🟢 SEKSI A","level":"Kab","question":"1 cm² = ... mm²","options":{"A":"10","B":"50","C":"100","D":"1.000"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"🟢 SEKSI A","level":"Kab","question":"1 km² = ... m²","options":{"A":"1.000","B":"10.000","C":"100.000","D":"1.000.000"},"answerKey":"D","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":5,"subTopic":"🟢 SEKSI A","level":"Kab","question":"5 m² = ... cm²","options":{"A":"500","B":"50.000","C":"5.000","D":"500.000"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":6,"subTopic":"🟢 SEKSI A","level":"Kab","question":"2 hm² = ... m²","options":{"A":"20.000","B":"2.000","C":"200","D":"200.000"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":7,"subTo